12
00:00:39,229 --> 00:00:40,229
<font color="#FFFF54">— Pai</font>

13
00:00:49,009 --> 00:00:51,479
<font color="#FFFF54">Oh, querido Papai.</font>

14
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:54,119
<font color="#FFFF54">E eu nunca soube.</font>

15
00:00:54,119 --> 00:00:55,380
<font color="#FFFF54">Nossa!</font>

16
00:00:58,250 --> 00:01:00,840
<font color="#FFFF54">D d d não seja ridículo!</font>

17
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,640
